title: 2 Peter 2:19-22 Notes
description: Notes on 2 Peter 2:19-22: the shift from the false teachers to the misled hearers, the latter end worse than the beginning, the four soils, believing in vain, and the passages on chastening and lost reward.
output: lessons/bible/2-peter-2-19-22.html

# Built from studies/data/notes/2-peter-2-19-22-notes.html, selecting its sentences and keeping their wording.
# Left off: the web-source tags (Bible.com, BibleRef.com, Wikipedia, Biblical Hermeneutics Stack Exchange, "+1"),
